<title>UK: Dunton Group to buy RMS Comm for 20 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Dunton Group to buy RMS Comm for 20 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>British property development group Dunton Group said on Thursday it would acquire RMS Communications Ltd for a total consideration of 20 million stg.</p>
</text>
